Package: awa.qwq672.iosonlineai
Name: iOS6AIChat
Version: 261025-10
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iOS 6 skeuomorphic-styled AI chat client
  Multi-provider (Zhipu GLM / OpenAI / Ollama) with optional
  transit relay (default api-ai.awa.lat), streaming SSE responses,
  conversation history, Markdown rendering, dark mode, font size
  adjustment, deep thinking toggle, Tavily web search integration
  and a settings page for transit URL / API Key / Model picker.
  Faithfully recreates the 2012-era iOS 6 look on any iOS
  version 6.0 and later.
Maintainer: qwq672 <qwq672@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: qwq672
Section: Applications
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Conflicts: awa.qwq672.iosonlineai-beta
Replaces: awa.qwq672.iosonlineai-beta
